                </content>
                <subsection eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-6__qstr-1__subsec-1">
                  <num>1</num>
                  <content>
                    <p>	(1)	A <b><i>specified 10 year period</i></b> is a period of 10 years beginning on:</p>
