                </subsection>
                <subsection eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-6__qstr-1__subsec-1A">
                  <num>1A</num>
                  <content>
                    <p>	(1A)	A person <b><i>meets the 4 years or less requirement</i></b> on a day in a period mentioned in <ref href="#sec-8">section 8</ref> or 9 if, on that day, the total number of days for which farm household allowance is payable to the person, in the specified 10 year period in which that day falls, does not exceed 1,460 days (assuming farm household allowance is payable to the person on that day).</p>
